	The first is about terminal definitions with PL4 of NH3.0.  Ever
since applying the lastest patch trying to play from specific terminals
produces the message "Terminal Must Backspace." and no nethack.
	In the terminal definition the offending option is (terminfo)
	cub1=\E[D.  If this is set to cub1=\b the game works fine.
	Pardon me but what is the )%(*@$(*&^%$*@ difference? Does it really
need to be a destructive backspace now?

Geez! Talk about picky! :-}
